-- Map data for the route planner, stored as PostGIS geometries (SRID 4326 / WGS 84).
--
-- Originally this was one flat points table with a sequence_order column for the
-- highways. Now each highway is a single LINESTRING, the state border is a POLYGON,
-- and the points of interest are POINTs. Coordinates in WKT are (lng lat).
--
-- Highway points come from OpenStreetMap via Geofabrik, and the border from the
-- PublicaMundi Mapping API.

